                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An excellent throwback to '80's arcade machines, this game is fast, furious, and /incredibly/ challenging.  Not for the faint of heart, even veteran gamers will stopped dead without focus, practice, and very quick reflexes.  I highly recommend this intense audiovisual experience, but only if you think you're up for it.  If you're not good at twitch reflex and aren't willing to spend a long time practicing, this game is not for you.",
